Here's a basic outline of how you can create a Chrome extension to achieve this:

**manifest.json**
```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "Price Adjuster",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Adjust prices based on user's Amazon profile",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": ["<all_urls>"],
      "js": ["contentScript.js"]
    }
  ],
  "permissions": ["activeTab", "https://www.amazon.com/*"],
  "background": {
    "service": "background.js"
  }
}
```

**background.js**
```javascript
chrome.tabs.onUpdated.addListener(function(tabId, changeInfo, tab) {
  if (changeInfo.status === 'complete') {
    chrome.tabs.sendMessage(tabId, { action: 'getAmazonProfile' });
  }
});

